OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum site consultation a 'win
OL,4,Afor democracy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has hailed a "win for local
OL,7,Fdemocracy" after the government agreed
OL,8,Fto consult the public on plans to build
OL,9,Faccommodation for asylum seekers on a
OL,10,Fformer military base.
OL,12,FThe Ministry of Housing, Communities
OL,13,Fand Local Government said residents
OL,14,Fcould submit their views on plans to
OL,15,Fhouse up to 1,256 men at the former
OL,16,FMinistry of Defence site near Bicester,
OL,17,FOxfordshire, until 17 September.
OL,19,FIt had previously made an Urgent Crown
OL,20,FDevelopment application, a special
OL,21,Fprocedure to fast track the process due
OL,22,Fto its "national importance".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
