OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum site consultation a 'win
OL,4,Afor democracy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Lib Dem MP Calum Miller said the
OL,7,Fplans had been "veiled in secrecy" and
OL,8,Fhad called on the prime minister to
OL,9,Fwithdraw the application.
